From: Cristodcgomez <cristo.c.mc@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc3: dwc3-msm: force vbus_active in peripheral mode

The T5 DT declares extcon=<charger eud>; without a charger vbus_active stays
false and the glue does not arm the cable (B_SESS_VLD), so the host never
enumerates even though the UDC exists. In dr_mode=peripheral, force it.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [dace bring-up]
Signed-off-by: Cristodcgomez <cristo.c.mc@gmail.com>
---

--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-msm-core.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-msm-core.c
@@ -5964,6 +5964,11 @@
 	if (of_property_read_bool(node, "qcom,msm-probe-core-init"))
 		dwc3_ext_event_notify(mdwc);
 
+	if (mdwc->dr_mode == USB_DR_MODE_PERIPHERAL) {
+		mdwc->vbus_active = true;
+		dwc3_ext_event_notify(mdwc);
+	}
+
 	return 0;
 
 put_dwc3:
